        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗</span><br><span class="line">║                    WORM NEST                         ║</span><br><span class="line">║               [碎 碎 念 - 虫巢初建志]                 ║</span><br><span class="line">║                                                      ║</span><br><span class="line">║  &gt; Status: ACTIVE_BLOGGING                           ║</span><br><span class="line">║  &gt; Access: PUBLIC                                    ║</span><br><span class="line">║  &gt; Author: Machli                                    ║</span><br><span class="line">║  &gt; Domain: amentnest.com                             ║</span><br><span class="line">╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="📋-目录-Table-of-Contents"><a href="#📋-目录-Table-of-Contents" class="headerlink" title="📋 目录 Table of Contents"></a>📋 目录 Table of Contents</h2><ol><li><a href="#%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D">🩺 个人情况介绍</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90">🐛 博客名字来源</a>  </li><li><a href="#%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%8F%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%8A%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1">🛤️ 个人经历及建站理由</a></li><li><a href="#%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E5%81%9A%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%83%85">🎯 想要做到的事情</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92">📝 内容规划</a></li><li><a href="#%E7%89%B9%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%8F%E7%9B%AE">🌟 特色栏目</a></li><li><a href="#%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%A0%88%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E9%93%BE">🚀 技术栈与工具链</a></li><li><a href="#%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97">📊 更新日志</a></li><li><a href="#%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F">🤝 联系方式</a></li><li><a href="#%E5%90%8E%E7%BB%AD%E8%A1%A5%E5%85%85%E6%A0%8F%E7%9B%AE">🔮 后续补充栏目</a></li></ol><hr><h2 id="🩺-个人情况介绍"><a href="#🩺-个人情况介绍" class="headerlink" title="🩺 个人情况介绍"></a>🩺 个人情况介绍</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">root@worm-nest:~# <span class="built_in">whoami</span> &amp;&amp; <span class="built_in">cat</span> /etc/user_profile</span><br><span class="line">machli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>基本信息 Basic Info</strong></p><ul><li><strong>代号</strong>: Machli</li><li><strong>身份</strong>: 临床医学本科生 | 计算机爱好者 | 哲学爱好者</li><li><strong>状态</strong>: 医学与技术的双轨探索中，努力成为数字时代的医者</li><li><strong>座右铭</strong>: “也许它被创造成形，是为了哪怕在瞬间之间，紧紧贴近你的心灵”</li></ul><p><strong>医学专业 Medical Background</strong></p><figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;专业&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;临床医学&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;年级&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;本科&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;学校&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;华南某综合类大学&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;专业方向&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;待定ing...&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;目标&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;成为既懂医学又懂技术的现代医者&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>技能树 Skill Tree</strong></p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="string">医学基础:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">解剖学:</span> <span class="string">██░░░░░░░░</span> <span class="number">20</span><span class="string">%</span> <span class="string">(大一课程)</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">生理学:</span> <span class="string">█░░░░░░░░░</span> <span class="number">10</span><span class="string">%</span> <span class="string">(准备学习)</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">病理学:</span> <span class="string">░░░░░░░░░░</span> <span class="number">0</span><span class="string">%</span> <span class="string">(未来课程)</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">药理学:</span> <span class="string">░░░░░░░░░░</span> <span class="number">0</span><span class="string">%</span> <span class="string">(未来课程)</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">技术技能:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">编程语言:</span> <span class="string">Python,</span> <span class="string">R,</span> <span class="string">JavaScript</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">数据分析:</span> <span class="string">pandas,</span> <span class="string">numpy,</span> <span class="string">matplotlib</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">前端开发:</span> <span class="string">HTML,</span> <span class="string">CSS,</span> <span class="string">Vue.js</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">博客搭建:</span> <span class="string">Hexo,</span> <span class="string">GitHub</span> <span class="string">Pages</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>当前状态 Current Status</strong></p><ul><li>📚 正在学习: 医学基础课程 + CS自学计划</li><li>💻 使用设备: 联想游戏本（48GB RAM + 2TB SSD）、MacBook Pro M4</li><li>☕ 学习燃料: 黑咖啡 + Absolute音乐 + 深夜思考</li><li>🎯 短期目标: 在大一结束前建立完整的知识管理体系</li></ul><hr><h2 id="🐛-博客名字来源"><a href="#🐛-博客名字来源" class="headerlink" title="🐛 博客名字来源"></a>🐛 博客名字来源</h2><h3 id="“WORM-NEST”-的诞生"><a href="#“WORM-NEST”-的诞生" class="headerlink" title="“WORM NEST” 的诞生"></a>“WORM NEST” 的诞生</h3><blockquote><p><em>“How at my sheet goes the same crooked worm.”</em><br>—— Dylan Thomas, <em>The force that through the green fuse drives the flower</em></p></blockquote><p>狄兰·托马斯在其进程诗学中多次使用”worm”（蠕虫）这一意象。在《The force that through the green fuse drives the flower》中，诗人写道：”How at my sheet goes the same crooked worm.” 这里的”crooked”蠕虫，看似是面临死亡前的挣扎，但这并非真正的死亡与腐败，而是新生的象征。</p><p><strong>WORM NEST（虫巢）<strong>这个名字是我在某个深夜兴致勃勃时想到的。它的意味并非仅仅是获得新生，更像是一个可以</strong>拨开我脑中迷雾</strong>的地方——一个思考的巢穴，一个知识发酵的空间，一个可以寄托梦想的平台。</p><p>就像蠕虫在土壤中翻腾，为植物的生长创造条件一样，我希望这个博客能够：</p><ul><li>🌱 <strong>翻耕知识的土壤</strong>：将复杂的医学概念通过技术手段更好地理解和记忆</li><li>🔄 <strong>促进思想的循环</strong>：在学习、思考、实践、分享中形成良性循环</li><li>🌿 <strong>孕育新的见解</strong>：在医学与技术的交叉点找到创新的可能性</li></ul><p>虫巢不仅是我个人的学习记录，更是一个<strong>数字化医学学习</strong>的实验场。</p><hr><h2 id="🛤️-个人经历及建站理由"><a href="#🛤️-个人经历及建站理由" class="headerlink" title="🛤️ 个人经历及建站理由"></a>🛤️ 个人经历及建站理由</h2><h3 id="Timeline-时间线"><a href="#Timeline-时间线" class="headerlink" title="Timeline 时间线"></a>Timeline 时间线</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">2024   ████████████████ 高考结束，转专业后选择医学专业</span><br><span class="line">2025   ██████████████ 大学入学，初次接触医学基础课程，创建虫巢博客</span><br><span class="line">未来   ████████████ 系统学习解剖学、生理学</span><br><span class="line">未来   ██████████ 病理学习，临床思维建立</span><br><span class="line">未来   ████████ 药理学深入，医学信息化探索</span><br><span class="line">未来   ██████ 临床实习，专业方向确定</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="建站初心-Why-Start-This-Blog"><a href="#建站初心-Why-Start-This-Blog" class="headerlink" title="建站初心 Why Start This Blog"></a>建站初心 Why Start This Blog</h3><p><strong>1. 学习记录 Learning Documentation</strong></p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">问题: 医学知识庞杂，传统笔记方式效率低下</span><br><span class="line">解决: 通过数字化博客系统化整理知识点</span><br><span class="line">效果: 建立个人医学知识库，提高学习效率</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>2. 知识分享 Knowledge Sharing</strong></p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">理念: 知识因分享而增值，医学因交流而进步</span><br><span class="line">目标: 分享学习方法、临床见解、技术应用</span><br><span class="line">希望: 帮助同行学子，推动医学教育创新</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>3. 跨界探索 Interdisciplinary Exploration</strong></p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">目的: 探索医学与计算机科学的结合点</span><br><span class="line">收获: 掌握数据分析、可视化等实用技能</span><br><span class="line">应用: 在临床决策、研究分析中发挥作用</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>4. 个人成长 Personal Growth</strong></p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">愿景: 成为既懂医学又懂技术的复合型人才</span><br><span class="line">方式: 通过写作思考，在教中学，在学中教</span><br><span class="line">目标: 建立自己的知识体系和价值观念</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="🎯-想要做到的事情"><a href="#🎯-想要做到的事情" class="headerlink" title="🎯 想要做到的事情"></a>🎯 想要做到的事情</h2><h3 id="短期目标-Short-term-Goals-3-6个月"><a href="#短期目标-Short-term-Goals-3-6个月" class="headerlink" title="短期目标 Short-term Goals (3-6个月)"></a>短期目标 Short-term Goals (3-6个月)</h3><p><strong>学业方面</strong></p><ul><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成大一医学基础课程学习</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 掌握基本的人体解剖学知识</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 建立医学学习的思维框架</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 培养良好的学习习惯和方法</li></ul><p><strong>博客方面</strong></p><ul><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 每周发布1-2篇学习笔记和感悟</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 建立医学新生学习资源库</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 建立读者交流社群（QQ群&#x2F;微信群）</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完善博客的搜索和分类功能</li></ul><h3 id="中期目标-Medium-term-Goals-6-12个月"><a href="#中期目标-Medium-term-Goals-6-12个月" class="headerlink" title="中期目标 Medium-term Goals (6-12个月)"></a>中期目标 Medium-term Goals (6-12个月)</h3><p><strong>专业发展</strong></p><ul><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成医学基础课程的深入学习</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 参与学校的科研训练项目</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 发表第一篇医学科普文章</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox