pan class="string">+</span> <span class="string">LaTeX</span> <span class="string">(数学公式)</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">Development:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">Node.js</span> <span class="number">18</span><span class="string">+</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">Git</span> <span class="string">version</span> <span class="string">control</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">VS</span> <span class="string">Code</span> <span class="string">+</span> <span class="string">Markdown</span> <span class="string">extensions</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">Typora</span> <span class="string">(Markdown编辑器)</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="📊-更新日志"><a href="#📊-更新日志" class="headerlink" title="📊 更新日志"></a>📊 更新日志</h2><h3 id="Version-1-0-0-2025-07-25"><a href="#Version-1-0-0-2025-07-25" class="headerlink" title="Version 1.0.0 (2025-07-25)"></a>Version 1.0.0 (2025-07-25)</h3><ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 博客框架搭建完成，选定Hexo + Butterfly主题</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 基础页面创建（首页、关于、分类、标签等）</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 内容框架规划，确定五大特色栏目</li></ul><h3 id="Version-1-1-0-2025-07-27"><a href="#Version-1-1-0-2025-07-27" class="headerlink" title="Version 1.1.0 (2025-07-27)"></a>Version 1.1.0 (2025-07-27)</h3><ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 域名配置完成 (amentnest.com)</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 碎碎念模板完成，建立个人品牌</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 栏目规划确定，明确内容方向</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> Giscus评论系统集成</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 全文搜索功能实现</li></ul><h3 id="Version-1-2-0-2025-08-04"><a href="#Version-1-2-0-2025-08-0